          "Title": "glibc: Non-progress DoS in EUC_JISX0213 -\u003e UCS-4 conversion state",
          "Description": "A flaw was found in glibc. A remote attacker could exploit this vulnerability by providing specially crafted input during SHIFT_JISX0213 to UCS-4 text conversion. This crafted input can cause the application to repeatedly process a buffered character without consuming further input, leading to a persistent loop and a denial of service (DoS) condition. This could make the affected application unresponsive.",
